/P 185 0 R
/E (          OUR INDIVIDUAL PROFESSIONAL SERVICES MAY INCLUDE ARCHITECTURAL DESIGN, CIVIL AND STRUCTURAL ENGINEERING, ELECTRICAL ENGINEERING, SANITARY AND PLUMBING DESIGN, MECHANICAL ENGINEERING, INTERIOR DESIGN, QUANTITY SURVEYING, COST ESTIMATION, AND CONSTRUCTION PROJECT MANAGEMENT. EACH SERVICE CONTRIBUTES TO THE SUCCESSFUL PLANNING, COORDINATION, AND EXECUTION OF A PROJECT, ENSURING THAT DESIGN CONCEPTS ARE ALIGNED WITH TECHNICAL REQUIREMENTS, APPLICABLE STANDARDS, AND CLIENT EXPECTATIONS. THROUGH COLLABORATION AMONG QUALIFIED PROFESSIONALS, JZI STUDIO & CONSTRUCTION SERVICES INC. AIMS TO PROVIDE INTEGRATED AND DEPENDABLE SOLUTIONS THAT CREATE LASTING VALUE FOR RESIDENTIAL, COMMERCIAL, AND OTHER DEVELOPMENT PROJECTS. PROFESSIONAL SERVICES REQUIRING LICENSES, REGISTRATIONS, OR SPECIFIC AUTHORIZATIONS ARE PROVIDED BY APPROPRIATELY QUALIFIED AND AUTHORIZED PRACTITIONERS.)
